-- handshake and assert the DUT's behavior:
--
--   1. order_valid_out asserts exactly ONE cycle after valid_in (1-cycle
--      pipeline) and is a one-cycle pulse.
--   2. buy_price_out  = mid - spread/2   where mid = (bid + ask) / 2
--      sell_price_out = mid + spread/2   (all Q16.16)
--   3. Check at least two different price/spread combinations.
--
-- Pick values that are exact in Q16.16 (multiples of 1/65536 — e.g. .00,
-- .25, .50) so the arithmetic shifts lose nothing.
--
-- Grade yourself:
--   uv run pytest tests/exercises/test_05_vhdl.py -v        (needs ghdl)
--   bash scripts/run_vhdl_tests.sh tb_market_maker
